## Production Reality

Always use `OncePerRequestFilter` for custom filters — it guarantees execution once per request even in forward/include scenarios. For REST APIs, disable session creation (`STATELESS`) and CSRF — they don't apply to stateless JWT APIs. Stateless auth means no server-side session storage, which is critical for horizontal scalability.

